              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihlazo likadadewenu, indodakazi kayihlo noma indodakazi kanyoko, kungakhathaliseki ukuthi wazalelwa ekhaya noma kwelinye, akufanele uwambule ihlazo labo.",
