        {
          "text": "Ungalidaluli ihlazo lowesifazane nendodakazi yakhe, futhi akumelwe uthathe indodakazi yendodana yakhe noma indodakazi yendodakazi yakhe ukuze umbule ihlazo layo; ngoba bayizihlobo zakhe eziseduze; kubi lokhu.",
